cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "handoff-fidelity: causal measurement of transmission versus reconstruction in chained language-model workflows"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for separating information that survives a language-model handoff
  from information the receiving model reconstructs, using availability
  interventions, design-based estimation and a matched-budget comparison
  protocol.
type: software
version: "v1-1"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - information transmission
  - evaluation
  - context compression
authors:
  - name: "The handoff-fidelity contributors"
